[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11341.11, "timestamp": "03:09:01", "text": "何てことだ。それが「意識高い系」と呼ばれるものか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11343.99, "timestamp": "03:09:03", "text": "人か何か？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11346.87, "timestamp": "03:09:06", "text": "ええ、そうだと思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11349.269, "timestamp": "03:09:09", "text": "私はラベルを貼るのが好きではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11351.59, "timestamp": "03:09:11", "text": "何かみたいなもの。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11355.11, "timestamp": "03:09:15", "text": "M それはみんなを呼ぶようなものだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11357.99, "timestamp": "03:09:17", "text": "例：DEIは新しい流行語だ、と人々は言う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11359.59, "timestamp": "03:09:19", "text": "今"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11361.269, "timestamp": "03:09:21", "text": "何か悪いことや"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11363.59, "timestamp": "03:09:23", "text": "ゲームにおける多様性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11367.83, "timestamp": "03:09:27", "text": "ああ、それはDEI（多様性、公平性、包括性）のせいで起こるんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11375.03, "timestamp": "03:09:35", "text": "それは包括性に関するもので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11378.95, "timestamp": "03:09:38", "text": "多様性とか、そういう類のもの。おお、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11383.51, "timestamp": "03:09:43", "text": "基本的に何が起こったかというと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11386.59, "timestamp": "03:09:46", "text": "多様性を持つために採用された"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11395.51, "timestamp": "03:09:55", "text": "なぜなら、よく考えてみれば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11397.99, "timestamp": "03:09:57", "text": "ゲームは既に多様化している。"}]